msgstr "Sgrùdaidhean taisbeanaidh"

msgid "Configure what displays are available for your content and forms."
msgstr ""
"Stèidhich dè na taisbeanaidhean a tha rim faighinn airson do "
"shusbaint is do fhoirmean."

msgid "Manage custom view modes."
msgstr "Halda eiginraktar view-modi."

