"Eisimpleirean:</p>\n"
"        <ul>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;img "
"src=\"\" data-caption=\"Seo an tuairisgeul\" /&gt;</code></li>\n"
"      "
"      <li><code>&lt;video src=\"\" data-caption=\"Dannsa Drupal\" "
"/&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            <li><code>&lt;blockquote "
"data-caption=\"Dries Buytaert\"&gt;Tha Drupal "
"uabhasach!&lt;/blockquote&gt;</code></li>\n"
"            "
"<li><code>&lt;code data-caption=\"Halò an t-saoghail ann an "
