"\n"
"Ein be request tae cance your account haes "
"been made at [site:name].\n"
"\n"
"You can nou cancel your account on "
"[site:url-brief] by clíckin this link or bi copin an pastin it intae "
"yer web browser:\n"
"\n"
"[user:cancel-url]\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: The cancellation o "
