"DOMPurify tha cheana an làthair aig @path. Cha leigear a-nuas "
"luchdachadh a-nuas."

msgid ""
"Drush was unable to download the DOMPurify library from @remote. "
"@exception"
msgstr ""
"Drush ean not tae dounload the DOMPurify leabharlann frae @remote. "
"@exception"

