"gallery id to avoid images being added manually to galleries. The "
"token was added as a security fix but some see the old behavior as an "
"feature and this settings makes it possible to remove the token."
msgstr ""
"Ma For On (standard), cuiridh Colorbox token sònraichte gach iarrtas "
"ris ris a’ ghailearaidh-id gus casg a chur air ìomhaighean a chur "
"le làimh ris na gailearaidhean. Chaidh an token a chur ris mar "
"chàradh tèarainteachd, ach tha cuid a’ faicinn an seann ghiùlan "
"mar fheart, agus leis na roghainnean seo tha e comasach an token a "
"thoirt air falbh."

