msgstr ""
"Tha am modúl seo a’ toirt taic gus leigeil le tagaichean meata "
"(meta) gnàthaichte a mhìneachadh agus a riaghladh."

msgid ""
"The module provides the option to create different <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">\"Custom Tags\"</a> to use for different "
