msgstr ""
"Tha am modail a’ toirt seachad an roghainn diofar <a "
"href=\":metatag_custom_tag\">“Tagaichean Co-chunntais”</a> a "
"chruthachadh airson diofar adhbharan a chleachdadh."

msgid "The best way of using Metatag: Custom Tags is as follows:"
msgstr ""
"An beste dòigh air Metatag: Custom Tags a chleachdadh ’s e seo mar "
"a leanas:"

msgid ""
"Create the <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom Tag\"</a>, "
