msgstr ""
"Cruthaich an <a href=\":metatag_custom_tag_create\">\"Custom "
"Tag\"</a>, lìon a-steach na luachan sònraichte a bu chòir a bhith "
"aig gach duilleag."

msgid "Configure Custom tags below."
msgstr "Configure Custom tags below."

