msgid ""
"Submission settings can be configured <a "
"href=\"@url\">here</a>.<br/>The ping protocol is <strong>being "
"deprecated</strong>, use IndexNow if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Raonan airson submit a ghabhas rèiteachadh <a href=\"@url\">an "
"seo</a>.<br/>Tha am protocòl ping <strong>air a bhith air a leigeil "
"seachad</strong>; cleachd IndexNow ma tha e iomchaidh."

