msgid ""
"Generates standard-compliant hreflang XML sitemaps to enhance your "
"site's SEO, notifies search engines of website changes via IndexNow "
"and sitemap ping protocols, and provides a framework for developing "
"other sitemap types."
msgstr ""
"Gineerir vanlike, standardsams hreflang XML-sitemaps gus do lloc "
"seoitimiseas SEO, stellet söekmasines i kennis um endringar i "
"nettsida via IndexNow og sitemap-ping-protokolla, og gjev eit "
"rammeverk for å utvikla andre sitemap-typar."

