msgstr "Redigeir sìmple XML-sitemap-instellings op einheiten-skjema."

msgid ""
"Send change notice to IndexNow compatible search engines right after "
"submitting entity forms. Changes include creating, deleting and "
"updating of an entity.<br/>This behavior can be overridden on entity "
"forms. Don't forget to <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">include "
"entities</a>."
msgstr ""
"Cuir fios mu dhathadh gu innealan-rannsachaidh co-chòrdail ri "
"IndexNow dìreach an dèidh dhut foirmean na h-ainneirtich a chur "
"a-steach. Tha na h-atharrachaidhean a’ gabhail a-steach cruthachadh, "
"sguabadh às agus ùrachadh a dhèanamh air aon eintiteas.<br/>’S "
"urrainn dhut an giùlan seo a chur an àite air foirmean na "
"h-eintiteis. Na dìochuimhnich <a href=\"@inclusion_url\">eintiteasan "
"a chur a-steach</a>."

