msgstr ""
"Gebeidh eitem ri fhaicsinn a bhios a’ toirt seachad luachan cur "
"a-steach webform a chaidh a thomhas, a’ cleachdadh Twig."

msgid ""
"Prevent SPAM webform submissions from being submitted without "
