msgstr ""
"Gabh a-steach gach eileamaid le prìobhaideachd is le cuingeachadh air "
"ruigsinneachd."

msgid ""
"Below columns are displayed to users who can view previous submissions "
"and/or pending drafts."
msgstr ""
"Na colbhan gu h-ìosal tèid a shealltainn do luchd-cleachdaidh a "
