msgid "There are no webform node references."
msgstr "Chan eil ceanglaichean ri nòdachan webform ann."

msgid "Provides starter templates that can be used to create new webforms."
msgstr ""
"Gibst tòiseachaidh teamplaidean a ghabhas cleachdadh gus "
"cruthachaidhean-lìn ùra a dhèanamh."

