msgid ""
"Form is being posted using a custom method. Confirmation page must be "
"handled by the <a href=\":href\">custom form action</a>."
msgstr ""
"Skjemaet tèaradh (posteadh) le dòigh gnàthaichte. Feumaidh an "
"duilleag dearbhaidh dèiligeadh ris le <a href=\":href\">action "
