msgstr ""
"Féigear a-mach XML-saitemap oidhcheil ann an @elapsed. Cleachdadh "
"cuimhne: @memory-peak."

msgid ""
"Generated by the <a href=\"@link-xmlsitemap\">Drupal XML Sitemap "
